bottled-lyftr
-------------

This repository packages Lyftr, a self-hosted workout, weightlifting,
bodyweight and nutrition tracker, as a Cloud in a Bottle app. It contains the
packaging material only (a Dockerfile, an app manifest, a start script, and a
small Python proxy that serves the app's web assets and forwards API requests
to the backend); no upstream source code is vendored here.

